{"id":"n72527-1-9","stage":5,"title":"일주 · 绕一周","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72527-1-9-1","ko":"나는 세계 일주를 하는 게 꿈이야.","zh":"我的梦想就是环游世界。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세계","meaning":"世界","explanation":"세계：世界","readings":[{"term":"세계","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62444","senseId":"1","lemma":"세계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일주를","meaning":"绕一周，周游","explanation":"일주：绕一周，周游；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일주","audio":"/audio/cda135d6d3ecb80e92ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72527","senseId":"1","lemma":"일주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꿈이야.","meaning":"梦想","explanation":"꿈：梦想；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"꿈","audio":"/audio/30fb5e8ccd7b82b30b61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57279","senseId":"2","lemma":"꿈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"28403a52feffec21","term":"세계","zh":"世界","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3","entryId":"62444","definition":"地球上的所有国家。","pronunciation":["세ː계","세ː게"]},{"i