","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽤","meaning":"颇，相当，还","explanation":"꽤：颇，相当，还","readings":[{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38264","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오래","meaning":"好久，很久","explanation":"오래：好久，很久","readings":[{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57308","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸리겠다.","meaning":"花费，消耗","explanation":"걸리다：花费，消耗；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"21","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3f2aa2e04cf60957","term":"지구","zh":"地球","audio":"/audio/3f2aa2e04cf60957ccf7.mp3","entryId":"62416","definition":"现在人类生活的，太阳系的第三颗行星。","pronunciation":["지구"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"c8e16f13560a8ff4","term":"바퀴","zh":"圈，周","audio":"/audio/c8e16f13560a8ff45d3f.mp3","entryId":"15819","definition":"计算画圈一样绕着一个圆形转动次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["바퀴"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"2dc53ba2c5ff682d","term":"돌다","zh":"运转，旋转","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3","entryId":"75006","definition":"以某物为中心，呈圆形移动。","pronunciation":["돌ː다"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"从某一时候到另一时候的期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"130a398219d202b0","term":"꽤","zh":"颇，相当，还","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3","entryId":"38264","definition":"预期或期待以上，相当。","pronunciation":["꽤"]},{"id":"2f64811b687303a9","term":"오래","zh":"好久，很久","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3","entryId":"57308","definition":"长时间。","pronunciation":["오래"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"花费，消耗","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"需要消磨时间。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/16f15c6354a40c32348f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.293,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72527","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0183,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我的梦想就是环游世界。","要绕地球一圈的话，估计需要相当长的时间。","听说强奸犯罪日益增多。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我的梦想就是环游世界。","要绕地球一圈的话，估计需要相当长的时间。","听说强奸犯罪日益增多。"],"answer":1}]}
